  1 ┃ Move                              Tasks                              ┃
 ┌ b┃ h j k l     move (or arrows)      enter       open                   ┃──┐
 │┌─┃ g G         first / last          n           new task / note        ┃─┐│
 ││ ┃                                   t           make task from note    ┃ ││
 ││ ┃ Views                             H L         move left / right      ┃ ││
 ││ ┃ 1 2 3       board / list / notes  s           status                 ┃ ││
 │└─┃ P           projects              p           priority               ┃─┘│
 │┌─┃ /           filter                #           labels                 ┃─┐│
 ││ ┃ o           sort (list)           e           edit (ctrl-g: vi)      ┃ ││
 ││ ┃ C N         canceled / notes      a           archive / restore      ┃ ││
 │└─┃ A           show archived                                            ┃ ││
 │  ┃ R           refresh               Detail                             ┃─┘│
 │  ┃                                   r           launch agent           ┃  │
 │  ┃ Boxes                             c           add comment            ┃  │
 │  ┃ tab         title ↔ description   [ ]         pick a comment         ┃  │
 │  ┃ ctrl-s      save                  e d         edit / delete it       ┃  │
 │  ┃ ctrl-g      open in vi            y           copy ref               ┃  │
 │  ┃ ctrl-r      earlier comments      esc         close                  ┃  │
 │  ┃                                                                      ┃  │
